### =========================================================
### NEWS-CONTROLLER
### Cubre: GET /api/v1/news
### =========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = viajero.test@xplorenow.com
@password = Password123

### Login (probar también si este endpoint es público)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------
### 1. Listado de noticias/ofertas/destinos destacados
### -----------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/news
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.b Sin token (para chequear si es público, ya que las noticias
### suelen mostrarse en Home sin requerir sesión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/news
